  "details": "Reproducing this seems to require not being in any groups.\n\n1.) Click on the Groups tab, no events are shown in the \"Group Events\" tab calendar, which is as expected.\n\n2.) Click on the Calendar icon at the top of the menu, it will show events from random groups that you're not even in. This is unexpected and inconsistent with the other calendar location.\n\nI would expect both of these places to be empty of events, since I'm not in any groups.",
